# Trivy ignore file used by the filesystem (SCA) and both image scans.
#
# Format: one vulnerability ID per line, optionally with an expiry date, e.g.
#   CVE-2026-00000 exp:2026-12-31
#
# Policy: only add an entry after reviewing the finding, with a comment that
# explains why it does not apply and who accepted the risk. Empty on purpose.
